{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47690","headline":"百字碑 · 吕岩","name":"百字碑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"养气忘言守，降心爲不爲。\n动静知宗祖，无事更寻谁。\n真常须应物，应物要不迷。\n不迷性自住，性住气自回。\n气回丹自结，壶中配坎离。\n阴阳生返复，普化一声雷。\n白云朝顶上，甘露洒须弥。\n自饮长生酒，逍遥谁得知。\n坐听无弦曲，明通造化机。\n都来二十句，端的上天梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}